NV_PK(24,{"up close the gold words read gate of entering virtue the two round stones above the door frame are door pins students passed under them on the way to class":"","this plaque reads dacheng gateway dacheng comes from confucius's title the sage who gathered all wisdom read the old words from right to left":"","inside minglun hall the whole great learning is written on the wall in the style of the famous calligrapher zhao mengfu its first line says learning means letting your good heart shine helping others become better and aiming for the very best":"","which photo shows the great learning on the wall of minglun hall":""});